{"case_id": "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q35", "domain": "unknown", "question": "对命主之描述？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据八字命理分析，日主为庚金，生于寅月（木旺之时），金处休囚之地。但年柱戊辰为厚土生金，时柱甲申有申金为庚金之根，且申中藏壬水，金气有根有生，不算太弱。庚金主骨骼、骨架，通常庚金旺或得生者骨架较大，但此命木旺克土，土生金之力有限，金气偏弱，故身形不会过于健壮。时支申金为驿马，主修长，且木火旺则人偏瘦，但土有生金，不至于过瘦。综合来看，金弱而木旺，木主瘦削，但土能生金，故为瘦长而非娇小或微胖。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q35", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_2_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3187, "response_id": "b770d873-9ce1-45fe-a777-3bc8ff0899d8", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 212, "completion_tokens": 178, "total_tokens": 390, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 84}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q36", "domain": "study", "question": "命主学历状况为何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据八字命理分析，日主癸水生于未月，土旺水弱，但年柱庚戌金生水，时柱己未土重，月干癸水得年干庚金生扶，日支卯木泄水，整体水势偏弱但有印星（庚金）生助，代表学业和智慧的印星有力。月柱癸未，未中藏丁火偏财，但未土为燥土，对水有克制，不过年柱庚戌为强金，能化土生水，形成“官印相生”的格局，主学业有成。时柱己未七杀透干，但得庚金印星化解，杀印相生，利于高学历。综合看，命主有较高学历，且印星得力，非普通学历，更符合博士层次。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q36", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_2_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 2900, "response_id": "1a475bd7-f7d7-42fd-853f-d051ba5b6578", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 213, "completion_tokens": 184, "total_tokens": 397, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 85}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q37", "domain": "career", "question": "命主出社会后的工作？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主癸水生于未月，土旺水弱，需金水帮扶。年柱庚戌为正印（庚金）坐官库，月柱癸未比肩坐七杀，时柱己未七杀透干，日支卯木为食神制杀。整体格局为“杀印相生”，官杀旺而印星化杀，适合稳定、体制内或管理型工作。\n\n年柱庚金正印透出，代表学历、文化、体制内背景，且庚金为阳金，有刚毅之象，适合进入工厂或国企这类有组织架构的单位。月柱癸未，比肩帮身，但未土为杀，说明早年有竞争压力，但能通过自身努力获得位置。时柱己未七杀强旺，但日支卯木食神制杀，说明有管理才能，但非纯商业冒险型。\n\n综合看，命主更倾向于进入有编制、稳定的大型机构，而非创业或纯商业。选项A“进入工厂，转入国企”最符合杀印相生、官星为用的格局，且庚戌年柱有“工厂”之象（庚为金属，戌为火库，象征工业）。其他选项如教师（需木火食伤明显）、企业高管（需财官强旺但无印）、创业（需食伤生财，但此命杀重印轻，不宜冒险）均不如A贴切。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q37", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_2_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4704, "response_id": "f37f6c1d-1909-4abd-ab93-7f572eee1bc2", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 225, "completion_tokens": 318, "total_tokens": 543, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 97}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q38", "domain": "career", "question": "命主早年一直在北京生活，直到哪个年龄有搬迁大变动，从北京去厦门工作？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：庚戌年、癸未月、癸卯日、己未时。日主癸水生于未月，土旺水弱，喜金水为用神。年柱庚金正印为用，早年在北京（北方属水）得地利，生活稳定。\n\n大运排法：年干庚为阳，男命顺排。月柱癸未，顺排大运为甲申、乙酉、丙戌、丁亥、戊子、己丑等。起运年龄计算：出生在7月22日，距下一个节气立秋（约8月7日）约16天，按三天折一年，约5年4个月起运，即约5岁起运。\n\n大运如下：\n- 5-14岁：甲申（金水相生，用神得力）\n- 15-24岁：乙酉（金旺生水，仍利）\n- 25-34岁：丙戌（火土旺，克水，压力增大，但戌为火库，土重，此运中后期有变动可能）\n- 35-44岁：丁亥（亥水为用，但丁火财星透，且亥卯未合木局，木泄水气，变动多）\n\n问题问“搬迁大变动，从北京去厦门”，厦门在南方（属火），离开北方水地，去南方火地，必在火土旺的大运或流年。丙戌大运（25-34岁）中，火土旺，尤其戌土为燥土，且与年支戌、月日时未土会成土局，土重克水，此运中后期（约30岁后）有迁移之象。但丙戌运中，丙火为财，戌为官杀库，压力大，但尚未到明显迁移。\n\n丁亥大运（35-44岁）中，丁火财星透干，亥水为用神，但亥卯未三合木局，木为食伤，食伤生财，且木主东方，但亥水被合，水弱，此运中木火旺，有离开北方去南方发展之象。且丁火为南方火，亥水被合，根基动摇，迁移明显。\n\n结合选项，27-31岁在丙戌运中，32-36岁仍在丙戌运末，37-41岁在丁亥运初，42-46岁在丁亥运中。丁亥运中，亥水被合，且丁火透出，迁移去南方最符合。但需看具体流年：丁亥运从35岁开始，37岁为丙戌年（2007年），38岁丁亥年（2008年），39岁戊子年（2009年），40岁己丑年（2010年），41岁庚寅年（2011年）。其中丁亥年（2008年）岁运并临，且亥卯未合木，木生火，火旺，迁移之象最强。但37-41岁涵盖此段，且丁亥运中，亥水为用但被合，主变动。\n\n综合判断，最可能是在37-41岁之间发生搬迁。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q38", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_2_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 7759, "response_id": "1e0bf07f-e7aa-4586-adb3-ecd9f7c3ee68", "usage": {"promp