{"case_id": "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q39", "domain": "health", "question": "命主身体状况为何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主癸水生于未月，土旺水弱，且月柱、时柱均为土（未、己未），土重克水，日主身弱。年柱庚戌，庚金生水但戌土亦克水，整体水势受制。日支卯木为食神，但被未土耗泄，木气不旺。时柱己未，七杀攻身，土重水浊，且未为燥土，易致水气枯竭。\n\n从五行平衡看，水弱而土旺，主肾、泌尿、内分泌系统易有隐患；土重水滞，也可能影响脾胃运化。日主癸水坐卯木，木主肝胆，但木弱被土耗，肝气不舒。时柱七杀贴身，压力大，易伤神。综合来看，命局水弱受克，且无强金生水，先天体质偏弱，易有慢性暗疾，且可能自幼显现，影响终身。\n\n选项分析：\nA. 从小患有暗疾，影响终身——符合水弱受克、土重水滞的先天体质特征。\nB. 长期失眠，精神不济——虽七杀攻身可能影响精神，但非最突出。\nC. 乏于运动，身体素质很好——与命局水弱土重矛盾。\nD. 身体素质好，但遭遇重大意外导致残缺——命局无金木交战或明显外伤信号，且水弱非强健之象。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "beijing_male_19700722_P008-Q39", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_2_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4404, "response_id": "f0ad1e1c-36c9-4dd0-b1e4-24a5325348fa", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 328, "total_tokens": 555, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 99}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
